    },
    {
      "text": "フルパワーで　ほのおの　こうげき。\nつかったあと　じぶんの　とくこうは\nがくっと　さがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "풀 파워로 불꽃 공격을 한다.\n사용한 뒤 자신의 특수공격이\n크게 떨어진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attaque l’ennemi à pleine puissance.\nLe contrecoup baisse énormément l’Attaque\nSpéciale du lanceur.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Angriff mit maximaler Kraft und feuriger Energie,\nder gleichzeitig den Spezial-Angriff des Angreifers\nsenkt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Quien lo usa puede vengar a sus amigos. El daño\ncausado será mayor si en el turno anterior han\ndebilitado a alguno.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa sferra un potente attacco, ma il\ncontraccolpo riduce di molto il suo Attacco\nSpeciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks the target at full power.\nThe attack’s recoil harshly lowers the\nuser’s Sp. Atk stat.",
